# Registry manifests are checksummed in registry.json by their exact bytes.
# Skill/bundle pins are computed over LF content (the git blob), so this
# repository must check out LF everywhere: a CRLF working copy (the default on
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true) would fail verify_sha256 for every skill
# during `axiom skill install --from-local-registry`.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
